# Renders a webhook misconfiguration (a bad endpoint secret, or a v2a Ed25519 key / endpoint-id) as a clean
# startup failure (description + action) rather than a raw stack trace. FailureAnalyzers are loaded before
# the application context, so they are registered here via spring.factories (not AutoConfiguration.imports).
org.springframework.boot.diagnostics.FailureAnalyzer=\
com.jinternals.webhooks.consumer.config.WebhookConfigurationFailureAnalyzer
